Troubleshooting Tips
Wazuh not starting:

Check logs: sudo tail -f /var/ossec/logs/ossec.log
Verify configuration: sudo /var/ossec/bin/ossec-control status
Restart service: sudo systemctl restart wazuh-manager
No alerts generated:

Ensure log files exist and are readable
Check Wazuh is monitoring correct files
Verify attack simulations executed successfully
Wait 2-3 minutes for log processing
Python script errors:

Verify Python 3 is installed: python3 --version
Check file permissions: ls -l ~/soc-lab/scripts/
Install missing packages: pip3 install [package]
Review error messages for specific issues
Zeek not capturing traffic:

Verify network interface: ip link show
Check Zeek process: ps aux | grep zeek
Review Zeek logs: tail -f /opt/zeek/logs/*.log
